{
  "_comment": [
    "MIGRATION FIXTURE for AUTHORED-TRAIT-RELATIONSHIPS-2026-09-10 slice 1.",
    "It expresses what GameConstants.WEAPON_TRIANGLE and CombatResolver._is_effective do",
